ew water  bottles being researched today are being  made out of biopolymer a material that's  composed of bacteria these bottles are  designed to biodegrade in just 18 months  that would help a lot as the world is  currently using over a million plastic  water bottles per minute other materials  and products would eventually have to  follow suit maybe one day we'll live in  a world where everything is  biodegradable even electronics but  that's a story for another  what if  [Music]

